    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "In terms of the condensed coefficients of identity, $ \\Delta_{xy} = \\Delta_1 + \\Delta_7 $, which reduces to $ \\Delta_7 $ in the absence of inbreeding.",
      "source_page": 156,
      "printed_page": 136,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter7:p010:b9"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        138.0,
