        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "e9f6e3519edb59f0b6b8b1d29557b57c9004e8fcbdf04b75b332b174774e6081"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Two examples will suffice to illustrate the use of this equation. First, consider the situation when x and y are full sibs, in which case the mothers are the same individual $ (m_{x}=m_{y}=m) $, as are the fathers $ f_{x}=f_{y}=f $. Equation 7.7 then reduces to",
