    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "If the parents are unrelated, then $ \\Theta_{mf} = 0 $; and if the parents are not inbred, then $ \\Theta_{mm} = \\Theta_{ff} = 1/2 $. Substituting these values into the above expression, we obtain $ \\Delta_{xy} = 1/4 $.",
      "source_page": 157,
      "printed_page": 137,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter7:p011:b5"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        50.0,
