    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Provided that the parents are unrelated, then $ \\Theta_{ff} = 1/2 $ and $ \\Theta_{mxm_y} = \\Theta_{mxf} = \\Theta_{fm_y} = 0 $, which yields $ \\Delta_{xy} = 0 $. The genotypes of two individuals cannot be identical by descent if their maternally (or paternally) derived genes come from unrelated individuals.",
